WEBVTT

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.010
It's about to begin.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.450
Yes.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.620
Do you think it will be another
painful battle?

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.280
No matter how much we pray,
we cannot stop time.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:28.320
We cannot stop this battle.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.710
Only I know your pain.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.210
Your uncertainty...

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.550
Your loneliness...

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.430
If only we could be together forever.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:01:00.770
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.950
I will not betray you!

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:57.490
If you remember anything regarding
this incident, let us know.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:58.420
Sure.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.110
No witnesses this time, either.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.710
This is headed for the U-Files.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.470
The Unknown Files?

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.180
Yeah, the unidentified.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.260
It's not our problem.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:21.050
Eternal Investigation

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.660
Who is he?

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.080
I've never

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.750
met him before, but...

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.860
I will not betray you.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.800
How does he...

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:50.720
Yuki-kun, we got it!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.850
Hurry up and make it!

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:58.750
Hold on.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.310
Hurry, hurry.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.900
I'm relieved Yuki-kun is on break.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:09.290
For some reason, the children do seem
calmer with Yuki-kun around.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:13.600
He has to leave this place once
he graduates, doesn't he?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.700
It can't be helped. It's policy.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.620
I wonder if anything could
be done about that.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:23.500
What do you think?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.320
It's beautiful.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.090
Wow, Yuki-kun.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.470
Looks like Yuki-chan's having fun.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.470
But will he be all right?

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:39.160
I was just wondering if he'll be able
to endure the upcoming battle.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.680
He's so kind and fair-skinned...

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:50.520
I'm also worried about you, Tsukumo.

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:55.180
You're as kind as Yuki-chan.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:59.400
I'll be fine. I have you, Toko-chan.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:04.450
There, there. Don't leave your sister.

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:14.350
Asahi
Orphanage

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:15.850
Yuki-nii!

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.390
The director wants to see you.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.640
Director's Office

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:27.650
I'm surprised a relative has come to see him.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.660
I'm sure he'll be delighted.

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:33.660
I certainly hope so.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:39.650
It took months to get here.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:43.800
Excuse me.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.300
You must be Yuki-kun.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.060
Nice to meet you. I am Giou Takashiro.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:12.240
Yuki, this man is your brother.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:15.320
This person

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.700
is my brother...

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:24.730
Let the ancient contract open
the gate of eternity.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:37.250
I am the gatekeeper of Raziel.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.970
Yuki...

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:44.890
What do you mean, you're my brother?

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:50.570
We have different mothers,
but I am certain you are my brother.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.720
After my mother passed away,

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.370
your mother met my father,
but the two never married.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:04.410
My father didn't find out about you
until after your mother passed away.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.830
I've been searching for you

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:11.130
since our father's passing, two years ago.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.410
But it's taken me quite a while to find you.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.250
I am terribly sorry.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.760
You don't need to be.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.990
Wakamiya Kanata

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:32.980
While it can never make up for everything
that's happened up till now,

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:38.920
would you come live with me in Tokyo
for both our father's and my own sake?

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:45.120
We only have each other.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.900
May I have some time to think it over?

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:57.010
Of course. It's an important decision.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.930
I see. Thank you.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.030
Is Yuki-chan okay?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.970
To be honest, I'm happy about
what my brother said.

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:33.730
I've always wondered who I am
and why I was born...

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:35.800
Yuki-kun!

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:45.910
Those children will need me.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:50.560
I have a home here.
If I stay here, I...

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.560
You're running.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.680
You're only running from
what you must do.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.450
You're only running.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.040
Running!

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.660
Hey, doesn't something seem odd to you?

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.670
I'm not running.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.540
Stop, Yuki!

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.260
I'm not!

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.180
Is everyone okay?

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.350
Is anyone hurt?

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:36.270
Yuki-chan did this...

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:39.660
He probably isn't doing it consciously yet.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.400
It's a difficult time.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.860
We need him to come with us
as soon as possible.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.390
Before his powers are fully awakened.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.420
That'd be best for Yuki-chan.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:06.100
What a relief.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:10.310
Yeah. No one was badly hurt.

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:12.660
Were these cracked?

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.740
Even if they were, they wouldn't
all break at once.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.270
I suppose not.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:19.730
Is it someone's idea of a joke?

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.290
Yuki...

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.990
Because of me...

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.220
Because of this power...

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.660
Everyone...

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:51.830
Yuki.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:55.460
Kanata-san.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.030
Are you all right?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.490
Why are you here?

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:05.910
I heard that a man, calling himself
your brother, stopped by.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:08.320
Yes.

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.830
Take your time.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.880
Your brother suddenly shows up.
You have every reason to be confused.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:25.430
You can stay with me
until things settle down.

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:28.550
Kanata-san, I...

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:32.070
I... I...

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:34.350
Yuki?

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:40.610
Sorry. It's nothing. I'm sorry
for worrying you.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:01.960
I really am fine. You worry
too much, Yuki-kun.

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:04.300
I'm so sorry.

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:06.690
What are you apologizing for, Yuki-nii?

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:09.500
Yeah, it's not your fault, Yuki-kun.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.370
You're so weird, Yuki-chan.

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:14.140
See you later.

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:21.720
Sakurai-kun.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:24.960
Good morning.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.900
You seem down.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.520
Not at all.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:32.700
You shouldn't worry about what
happened with Uzuki yesterday.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:35.160
Yeah, forget about him.

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:44.140
He was abandoned by his parents,
just like I was. What's so special about him?

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:48.040
Upset that he gets all the attention?

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:53.390
Are you content letting him
look down on you?

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:57.350
On top of that, he pities you.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:03.360
No. I don't want to be pathetic. I refuse!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:07.930
What do you desire? What do you want?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:11.280
Power. I want power.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.350
Please give me power.

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.730
Where did all this come from?

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.230
The power of darkness is growing.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.120
What? A love letter?

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.420
I knew we had a lot of rivals.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.340
I need to start working harder.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.150
You've got the wrong idea.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:14.720
Uzuki-kun...

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:22.140
About yesterday... I really
didn't mean to do that.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.910
Don't touch me!

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:32.260
Sakurai Yuki, die!!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.040
Uzuki-kun...

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.200
You're a nuisance.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:44.160
I hate your goody two-shoes,
know-it-all act.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.690
What's his problem?

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.340
Doesn't he seem different?

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:54.630
I'm not your friend. I felt bad for you,
so I thought I'd try being nice,

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:58.390
but you misunderstood.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.220
No one needs you.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:04.310
Yuki!

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:23.500
No one needs you.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:34.770
I did it again...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.900
How did this happen?

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.860
I... I...

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:52.980
I'm here.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.920
I want to see him.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.510
You'll get wet.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.960
So will you.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.750
How is Yuki-chan doing?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.910
He's fine.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.610
He's calmed down.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.280
What happened?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:47.800
Maybe I'm not kind at all.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:49.920
Fool.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:58.980
That would never even occur
to the truly unkind.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:13.400
I've always been able to see and
hear things others can't.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:21.210
Lately, that power has been
increasing. I can't stop it.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:26.380
I don't want to see things.
I don't want to hurt anyone.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:31.590
I couldn't do anything about Uzuki-kun.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.560
Why do you care about that human?

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.990
Because we're friends.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.380
Even though he said we're not,

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:45.420
he was the only one to reach
out to me when I was alone.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.930
But I...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:55.980
You've walked a dark path.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.130
I hurt him.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.390
It's not your fault.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:08.340
He doesn't want to see the truth.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:10.960
He avoids the truth by attacking others.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:17.520
If he fails to do so, he feels dead.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.800
But we're still friends...

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.390
Humans are complicated.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:35.110
If it's not too much to ask...

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.320
could you tell me your name?

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.150
Zess.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.460
Will I see you again?

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:53.120
Zess-san?

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.280
What are those?

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:13.840
Duras.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:14.730
Duras?

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:16.480
They're demons.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.510
Demons...

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:55.940
You okay, Yuki-chan?

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:57.900
Sorry we're late.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.940
You're...

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:14.420
They're members of the Giou
Clan, just like you.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.680
Takashiro-san.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:20.470
Good work, Toko and Tsukumo.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.710
You as well, Zess.

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:25.380
Zess-san, too?

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.330
He isn't of the Giou Clan.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:33.010
His case is a little complicated.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.430
I don't understand.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:39.350
I suppose you would be confused.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:48.110
As you can see, the members of the
Giou Clan possess special abilities.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:54.370
And, they symbolize our clan.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.900
It seems you know what I'm talking about.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:04.230
Your powers will continue to grow.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:08.920
You will fear them.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:15.100
I'm an ordinary high school
student. I'm an ordinary...

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.390
I'm...

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:26.810
If you come with us, we will teach
you knowledge, control,

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:32.160
and the means to cope with those powers.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:35.950
That is the best path for you.

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:37.610
Yuki.

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:50.630
Time began to move too quickly.

00:21:51.070 --> 00:22:00.940
Until this point, I'd thought I'd be able
to continue in my ordinary life.

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:36.950
Takashiro-san.

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:38.070
What is it, Yuki?

00:23:38.070 --> 00:23:43.620
Do you prefer a Japanese
or Western breakfast?

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:47.060
I suppose I prefer Japanese breakfasts,
but sometimes I crave melon bread.

00:23:47.060 --> 00:23:47.810
Walpurgis Night

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:49.170
Melon bread?

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:49.860
Walpurgis Night
